  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Food is a subject of conversation more spiritually refreshing even than the weather, for the number of possible remarks about the weather is limited, whereas of food you can talk on and on and on.",
      "output_sha256": "32b10dafcd8cf67bad3dc2b742fd8ee1037557f6a9f08c8b22c99ea7f203a232",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "32b10dafcd8cf67bad3dc2b742fd8ee1037557f6a9f08c8b22c99ea7f203a232",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Moreover, no heat of controversy is induced by mention of the atmospheric conditions (seeing that we are all agreed as to what is a good day and what is a bad one), and where there can be no controversy there can be no intimacy in agreement.",
      "output_sha256": "45b2fc7375a20260e8bf85208e2d386257565e1d330dbb37d6d9ced0c67460dd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "45b2fc7375a20260e8bf85208e2d386257565e1d330dbb37d6d9ced0c67460dd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But tastes in food differ so sharply (as has been well said in Latin and, I believe, also in French) that a pronounced agreement in them is of all bonds of union the most intimate.",
      "output_sha256": "0c9e752a92b86d118157fd4381e838975b388075204d2a8c3729763da10d0285",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c9e752a92b86d118157fd4381e838975b388075204d2a8c3729763da10d0285",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Thus, if a man hates tapioca pudding he is a good fellow and my friend.",
      "output_sha256": "92d99d2a594f0e29bbcbd57a7124c8102732c49c941c5438a4f8d6168f1c85a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "92d99d2a594f0e29bbcbd57a7124c8102732c49c941c5438a4f8d6168f1c85a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To each his favourite meal.",
      "output_sha256": "2ac31093279c7fea9d3420db67277f94e18ee52b431cdff99bdf68c02fab5c95",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ac31093279c7fea9d3420db67277f94e18ee52b431cdff99bdf68c02fab5c95",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But if I say that lunch is mine I do not mean that I should like lunch for breakfast, dinner, and tea; I do not mean that of the four meals (or five, counting supper) lunch is the one which I most enjoy—at which I do myself most complete justice.",
      "output_sha256": "51211c8ee7403df8fcf6ad1681b045f39298224648b1276bb926f6be069c480f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "51211c8ee7403df8fcf6ad1681b045f39298224648b1276bb926f6be069c480f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "This is so far from being true that I frequently miss lunch altogether … the exigencies of the journalistic profession.",
      "output_sha256": "ec6fd699fee278f0a3a23a1a6fed01bc9762932fcafc5342e746a1f4d702f99f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "ec6fd699fee278f0a3a23a1a6fed01bc9762932fcafc5342e746a1f4d702f99f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Today, for instance, I will likely miss out on it.",
      "output_sha256": "aa60a4fdfef877931d0a83439611f8715aab4ed948ec3170a467987206f0df72",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.476667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7c2a3edbe046f80d5df4511f0e669bde7c63e7d36d292306078c9c6de3842981"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "aa60a4fdfef877931d0a83439611f8715aab4ed948ec3170a467987206f0df72",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "What I truly mean is that, in its essence, lunch captivates me most because of its inclusive nature.",
      "output_sha256": "269188f384ac0e5b27477db751411082fe3f16eb13672cbb6934ee17a4f5c883",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.511136,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2423261fb4be7565e6adc4f159c893b10a234899a4f0a6bd380a712200cf5836"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "269188f384ac0e5b27477db751411082fe3f16eb13672cbb6934ee17a4f5c883",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "At home, we typically enjoy breakfast and dinner, but lunch is a meal that we indulge in while out in London.",
      "output_sha256": "c6f262308575ca1cfb134f9f1762d0356b0475f0de6577ea1a33bba809f46946",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.365565,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8adcc73c4cc42d99f1afc69b98fee82dd671e3d2eb28d21a5dba3cc219a6ba4b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c6f262308575ca1cfb134f9f1762d0356b0475f0de6577ea1a33bba809f46946",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The city offers an incredible array of choices.",
      "output_sha256": "0824201572c8c29872162d20fcd4654b75edcbe15abdd2c45164a74f60406ab5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.365565,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8adcc73c4cc42d99f1afc69b98fee82dd671e3d2eb28d21a5dba3cc219a6ba4b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0824201572c8c29872162d20fcd4654b75edcbe15abdd2c45164a74f60406ab5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We can have six courses and a bottle of champagne, with a view of the river, or one poached egg and a box of dominoes, with a view of the skylights; we can sit or we can stand, and without doubt we could, if we wished, recline in the Roman fashion; we can spend two hours or five minutes at it; we can have something different, every day of the week, or cling permanently (as I know one man to do) to a chop and chips—and what you do with the chips I have never discovered, for they combine so little of nourishment with so much of inconvenience that Nature can never have meant them for provender.",
      "output_sha256": "42af860538a648812555d80b058d622183651defeb17ec243dd9821c758be424",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "42af860538a648812555d80b058d622183651defeb17ec243dd9821c758be424",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps as counters. … But I am wandering from my theme.",
      "output_sha256": "82edd352f99c56fe1e0542d5e25037471abbc2ba4b71f90dc6c241aa5cf5537a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "82edd352f99c56fe1e0542d5e25037471abbc2ba4b71f90dc6c241aa5cf5537a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is this of romance about lunch, that one can imagine great adventures with stockbrokers, actor-managers, publishers, and other demigods to have had their birth at the luncheon table.",
      "output_sha256": "00403d98b13abc6dec39c44d7857d0d9897a465e78da4b81f931e6feb43ee0b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "00403d98b13abc6dec39c44d7857d0d9897a465e78da4b81f931e6feb43ee0b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When it comes to critical discussions, whether it’s about the latest financial maneuvers or the title of a new play, the invitation remains constant: “Let’s have lunch, and we can discuss it.”",
      "output_sha256": "68652d2a215f80af71dcd8a1790e47393ec93ba21d9970a9626313eab2e19b82",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.286218,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1d74543b126af7a556168514574e75e18ed9113c54a46b402e6e7b4f28c908f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "68652d2a215f80af71dcd8a1790e47393ec93ba21d9970a9626313eab2e19b82",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20,
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Once the waiter takes your coat and hat, and you glance uncertainly at the menu, there’s a camaraderie that develops.",
      "output_sha256": "9bc42d32e506b61cbcbc44dbfea3463815f561f39c372188f8deedc153366302",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.286218,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1d74543b126af7a556168514574e75e18ed9113c54a46b402e6e7b4f28c908f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9bc42d32e506b61cbcbc44dbfea3463815f561f39c372188f8deedc153366302",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20,
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When asked, “What will you drink?” the polite response is often, “Oh, anything you’re having,” demonstrating your willingness to share.",
      "output_sha256": "a2dd5e022488abac14c105c903db1e936370a64ec2a14c43179a1f9e934d3ac1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.286218,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1d74543b126af7a556168514574e75e18ed9113c54a46b402e6e7b4f28c908f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a2dd5e022488abac14c105c903db1e936370a64ec2a14c43179a1f9e934d3ac1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20,
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And not only does one inaugurate business matters at lunch, but one also renews old friendships.",
      "output_sha256": "deabfcc32f629f7e2909ba42f6a5d8c96e70f56c45fdada7eb71a9744021dedf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "deabfcc32f629f7e2909ba42f6a5d8c96e70f56c45fdada7eb71a9744021dedf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Who has not had said to him in the Strand, \"Hallo, old fellow, I haven't seen you for ages; you must come and lunch with me one day\"?",
      "output_sha256": "c674d2a6ba83b119c9f9d72ede1a32aea45c14998120c25fb8ba1dcc8fb44230",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "c674d2a6ba83b119c9f9d72ede1a32aea45c14998120c25fb8ba1dcc8fb44230",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And who has not answered, \"Rather!",
      "output_sha256": "359a3d7f8d3969527bd8a9c7355e0c2928bb0a36546ff042856b04a4f9ea24d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "359a3d7f8d3969527bd8a9c7355e0c2928bb0a36546ff042856b04a4f9ea24d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I would love that,” often leaves you with a warm glow that lingers until the next day, when the moment is all but forgotten.",
      "output_sha256": "260e85667fbd9ad59479d49343356b2419ebe0d62864273241c11386e1ba5de2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.53719,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6ca273371c8dcb333f0cc7c8c6e79a2655fdd8ee62ed2e54553757c6f04a83a6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "260e85667fbd9ad59479d49343356b2419ebe0d62864273241c11386e1ba5de2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "An invitation to dinner is formal, to tea unnecessary, to breakfast impossible, but there is a casualness, very friendly and pleasant, about invitations to lunch which make them complete in themselves, and in no way dependent on any lunch which may or may not follow.",
      "output_sha256": "b900d047c3857005f43ec8af37a219ac3738dfe107a087257d165e5d0a21db8c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "b900d047c3857005f43ec8af37a219ac3738dfe107a087257d165e5d0a21db8c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Without having exhausted the subject of lunch in London (and I should like to say that it is now certain that I shall not have time to partake to-day), let us consider for a moment lunch in the country.",
      "output_sha256": "231fa9d25785cbab44e25190cbb65408fbcfd90fa7bf249869593e4857834819",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "231fa9d25785cbab44e25190cbb65408fbcfd90fa7bf249869593e4857834819",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I do not mean lunch in the open air, for it is obvious that there is no meal so heavenly as lunch thus eaten, and in a short article like this I have no time in which to dwell upon the obvious.",
      "output_sha256": "414bdd679964c623d1d92bcd76b7659daada145cc4f55c8a031b52c45f48c29e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "414bdd679964c623d1d92bcd76b7659daada145cc4f55c8a031b52c45f48c29e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I mean lunch at a country house.",
      "output_sha256": "552ad896516b951494a2308775e50535b77235c2df7068be67ce31051c3f7156",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "552ad896516b951494a2308775e50535b77235c2df7068be67ce31051c3f7156",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Now, the most pleasant feature of lunch at a country house is this—that you may sit next to whomsoever you please.",
      "output_sha256": "3bd5b61eafe9362df1a512851515d984158dfed0ab95008181ee2f1a1802322e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "3bd5b61eafe9362df1a512851515d984158dfed0ab95008181ee2f1a1802322e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "At dinner, you might find yourself seated next to someone entirely unappealing; breakfast presents the challenge of arriving at the right moment to claim a seat next to someone special; and during tea, your chair could easily be taken as you step away for a moment.",
      "output_sha256": "e22f59af9e34d2f87ba09be62c675d9dacedd18134606a5f93cafcf92524af05",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.339744,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4c6383359d892f641dda0b846e6c3ccaaab1169bfb5c49361360e814b9109a90"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e22f59af9e34d2f87ba09be62c675d9dacedd18134606a5f93cafcf92524af05",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34,
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "But at lunch, you simply follow the person of your interest in, and there you are—securely placed.",
      "output_sha256": "6edc7dfc7c4a03b29d254e8ba18331c8c62d5b64ffbc8d036aef7b11e39be60b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.339744,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4c6383359d892f641dda0b846e6c3ccaaab1169bfb5c49361360e814b9109a90"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6edc7dfc7c4a03b29d254e8ba18331c8c62d5b64ffbc8d036aef7b11e39be60b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34,
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, there exists a unique environment that surpasses both urban and rural experiences, one that encapsulates the joys of lunch more than any other: lunch on a train.",
      "output_sha256": "1fe1d9c6ea370549bac5e641f3d42a15e6c3f6bc3de274f83ad3a2460e5ac9d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.303593,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25,
        26,
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6a4732f22dc7fce75354301c1e65135d30319041dff7f3d647e2848d7141fcca",
        "83176153dd2bdd323acd8f1ba9a900d591674662c8d404f5828c41f64449288a",
        "4090e24958f928ab450e07422b64ae68c8cf1cda37a00f74cab8eb73e29005aa"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1fe1d9c6ea370549bac5e641f3d42a15e6c3f6bc3de274f83ad3a2460e5ac9d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It should be the \"second meal\"—about 1.30— because then you are really some distance from London and are hungry.",
      "output_sha256": "67483827191f6d8c18c5c4bfe93689518dc759657a629d81407f9ca00992a8c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
